{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2023-05-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL MANAGEMENT TO PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT EVERCORE ISI CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY (NYSE: CPB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MARK CLOUSE, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND CARRIE ANDERSON, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE 3RD ANNUAL EVERCORE ISI CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 14, 2023 AT 4:15 P.M. EST. THE DISCUSSION WILL BE AVAILABLE VIA A LISTEN-ONLY LIVE WEBCAST ACCESSIBLE AT HTTPS://WSW.COM/WEBCAST/EVERCORE36/CPB/2144244. THE WEBC.'}